#N canvas 60 60 980 760 12;
#X text 20 10 glitch_post: shared per-effect output stage. Only one effect sounds at a time \, so JUCE snaps this stage's filter/pan/mix/gain to the firing effect's stored settings at each trigger. Also hosts the de-click fade broadcast and the step envelope.;
